@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- **Laravel route names.** Duplicate statically discovered route names report their declaration locations, including grouped and resource routes. Imported facade aliases retain their identity and unrelated imports are excluded. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
+
 - **Native type suggestions follow the PHP target and declaration.** Parameter and property types exclude return-only types, while modern and composed types follow their supported language versions. PHPDoc and project-class suggestions retain their own behavior. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
 
 - **Built-in classes follow older PHP targets.** Classes introduced in a later PHP release no longer appear in completion or return through another stub loaded into memory. Project-defined polyfills remain available.
